  "description": "Tamp diagnostic library for testcontainers-dotnet pipelines. Probes whether the current process can reach Docker (socket / DOCKER_HOST / `docker info` exit code) AND whether the process is itself running inside Docker without a mounted socket — the \"sibling containers\" trap that silently makes integration tests hang. Returns a typed DockerCapability for OnlyWhen() gates and diagnostic logs. Not a CLI wrapper.",
